name: Overstock Plus — max shop slots
author: corpus
description: >-
  Overstock Plus adds another shop card slot and immediately restocks empty slots. Tier-2
  voucher: requires Overstock bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2.
  RAG aliases: bigger shop, shop spam, reroll value, more items.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: OverstockPlus
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - voucher: RerollSurplus
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: FlashCard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: ChaostheClown
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
